#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:3
#: f32d25a765aa42deb9cb71eb850fbe41
msgid "有限晶胞合金占位（Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy）"
msgstr "Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:5
#: 7e3249576b454cb6a3fd6b19db1d6572
msgid "**分类：** 合金与组分"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:7
#: 0e25690af80244e9b3b572cc8947ae79
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:9
#: 081c684ec2fe4af9a99e5b625ee7d313
msgid ""
"按有限位点上真正可实现的整数计数生成合金占位。输入若含 "
"`atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]`，每个子晶格独立约束；普通结构则全部位点组成名"
"为 `all` 的单一 site set。"
msgstr ""
"Generate alloy occupancies from integer counts that are actually realizable "
"on a finite set of sites. If the input contains "
"`atoms.arrays[\"sublattice\"]`, each sublattice is constrained "
"independently; otherwise all sites form one site set named `all`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:11
#: 43665629b20542b892cf9eee3e086053
msgid ""
"组成计划先确定每种元素的整数个数，再生成不重复的随机排布。卡片不会先采任意连"
"续比例再静默取整，也不会把不可整除的目标写成 Exact。metadata 同时保存请求、实"
"际计数、实际分数、composition ID 和 arrangement ID。"
msgstr ""
"A composition plan first fixes an integer count for every element, then "
"generates unique randomized arrangements. The card never samples an "
"arbitrary continuous fraction and rounds it silently, nor labels an "
"indivisible target as Exact. Metadata records the request, actual counts and "
"fractions, composition ID, and arrangement ID."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:13
#: 4d2237ecf268490ea97f6d94862bd6a8
msgid ""
"卡片主界面是可视化规则编辑器。先选择“全部位点”或“按子晶格”，再为每个位点集合"
"添加元素，并选择一种组成模式。模式切换后只显示当前需要的比例或计数字段："
msgstr ""
"The main card UI is a visual rule editor. Choose All Sites or By Sublattice, "
"add elements to each site set, and select a composition mode. Changing modes "
"shows only the fraction or count fields that apply:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:15
#: 610b6131dfd64b3b8ad66f3b1aa5c899
msgid ""
"`fixed_fraction`：给出固定目标比例；可整除时记为 `exact`，否则采用确定性的最"
"近整数计划并记为 `nearest_integer`。"
msgstr ""
"`fixed_fraction`: specify fixed target fractions. A divisible target is "
"marked `exact`; otherwise the card uses a deterministic nearest-integer plan "
"marked `nearest_integer`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:16
#: 4b9b8d09f28b46308854b01205983b63
msgid "`fraction_range`：枚举实际整数分数落在各元素范围内的计划。"
msgstr ""
"`fraction_range`: enumerate plans whose realized integer fractions fall "
"within each element's range."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:17
#: 75bb6b26bf96425497d589836e2799d0
msgid "`count_range`：枚举各元素整数计数落在范围内且总和等于位点数的计划。"
msgstr ""
"`count_range`: enumerate plans whose integer counts fall within each "
"element's range and sum to the number of sites."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:19
#: 98da292f090441928ab08d8a5f7b1b72
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principle and equations"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:21
#: 17ff95eb51924a0e962edabbd9868723
msgid "有限晶胞不能实现任意连续比例。若一个子晶格有 $N$ 个位点，程序枚举满足"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:23
#: 3c96caa55869470a83faa0d702b35b2b
msgid ""
"\n"
"n_e\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0},\\qquad \\sum_e n_e=N\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:27
#: b0d8ec17eeb54f94aba32ceda9ada727
msgid ""
"且落入用户比例/计数上下限的可行整数向量。比例范围会转换为 $\\lceil f_{e,"
"\\min}N\\rceil\\le n_e\\le\\lfloor f_{e,\\max}N\\rfloor$；固定比例用最大余数"
"法 得到和为 $N$ 的计数。给定计数向量时，不同占位排列数为"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:31
#: 9bebc664d09d4ec4bcf086cb1624220d
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Omega=\\frac{N!}{\\prod_e n_e!}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:35
#: 95f42e44c48448ddbc37803804d9e176
msgid ""
"多个独立子晶格的组合数是各自 $\\Omega$ 的乘积。卡片在可行组合中去重采样，并受"
"每组和 总输出上限约束；它不会声称已穷举超出预算的全部排列。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:38
#: d2971e201e3c49f8a7b765d4ad5f993c
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:40
#: 74f83e13582d4354a269dd8818465225
msgid "场景：小晶胞 HEA 的“目标 20%”反复落到同一个实际组成"
msgstr ""
"Scenario: a nominal 20% target in a small-cell HEA repeatedly maps to the "
"same realized composition"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:42
#: bd5f3e42697c4ceab8848f7313c51e8d
msgid ""
"32 位点随机固溶体经过连续 Composition Space Sampling 后再取整，多个目标点可能"
"都变成同一整数计数组合，训练集看似有很多组成，实际却重复。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:44
#: 9deed2f1027a4a18a11cc52f4bb2c70b
msgid ""
"**输入：** 32 原子 A1/fcc 周期超胞。 **目标：** 直接枚举 Fe/Co/Ni 的可实现整"
"数计数，并为每个组成生成 4 个不同排布。 **参数设置：** `位点划分规则`使用“全"
"部位点”（若输入含 A 单子晶格则用 `A`）和“计数范围”， 给三种元素明确整数范围；"
"`每种成分的排列数`填 `4`，固定`随机种子`，并设置 `每个输入的最大输出数`。 **"
"输出：** 每个 composition ID 对应唯一整数计数组合；同一 composition 下的 "
"arrangement ID 不重复。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 统计 metadata 中的 "
"`counts`，确认每帧总和为 32、composition ID 无重复；重训时再按实际分数切片比"
"较误差，而不是按原连续目标比例分组。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:52
#: b1591d188f9544ef8aaa0c3c645bb219
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:54
#: 11bd44617ab4467f9ff5350440390bb0
msgid "位点划分规则（site_rules）"
msgstr "site_rules"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:56
#: 8afd25e649694e6798d136e928cf5865
msgid ""
"默认界面先显示 A/B 规则模板中的 `X` 占位符，但 `X` 不是可输出的元素。接入上游"
"结构且规则尚未被手动编辑时，卡片会立即按首个输入结构的实际 site set、元素和当"
"前比例生成安全规则。例如 Ni/Al 的 A/B 结构会自动得到真实的 Ni、Al 规则，而不"
"会生成 `X` 原子。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:58
#: e316be9c7631461f81d0078d1ce5a5bf
msgid ""
"{\"A\":{\"composition\":{\"X\":1.0},\"elements\":[\"X\"],\"mode\":"
"\"fixed_fraction\"},\"B\":{\"composition\":{\"X\":1.0},\"elements\":[\"X\"],"
"\"mode\":\"fixed_fraction\"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\"A\":{\"composition\":{\"X\":1.0},\"elements\":[\"X\"],\"mode\":"
"\"fixed_fraction\"},\"B\":{\"composition\":{\"X\":1.0},\"elements\":[\"X\"],"
"\"mode\":\"fixed_fraction\"}}\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:62
#: bb3fdfdf61b04638a03fb0b6f3033587
msgid ""
"“无子晶格标签（all）”模板会建立 `all` 规则；“A/B 子晶格”模板会建立彼此独立的 "
"A、B 规则。JSON 顶层 key 必须与输入的 site set 完全一致。有 `sublattice` 时逐"
"个编辑 A、B 等标签；没有时使用 `all`。卡片不会把 `all` 静默套到每个子晶格，也"
"不会使用 `group` 代替 `sublattice`。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:64
#: c22b96b74d814c49a81dc01a8d89e74a
msgid ""
"规则仍由卡片自动管理时，载入上游结构会按实际标签和元素自动匹配：普通无标签结"
"构使用 `all`，A1/A2/A3 等单子晶格原型使用单独的 `A` 规则，L1₂/B2/L1₀ 保持 A/"
"B。界面会明确提示自动匹配结果。只要用户编辑过规则、主动选择过模板、粘贴过 "
"JSON 或载入过持久化参数，卡片就不再自动覆盖，标签不匹配或仍含 `X` 时改为显示"
"错误。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:66
#: 0cc776b719c14d93a397c210c5c339c4
msgid ""
"切换位点划分或应用模板会整体替换当前规则。已有手动编辑时，界面会先确认，避免"
"误删元素、范围和 site set。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:68
#: 2737b8c3d30e4d00993c68b4d1bed37f
msgid ""
"输入结构可用后，界面会在对应规则旁显示实际位点数，并即时提示缺少标签、多余标"
"签、非法/重复元素、范围错误和无整数解。底层持久化仍是 `位点划分规则`"
"（`site_rules`）字符串；“高级：查看/粘贴 JSON”默认收起，可用于复制现有格式或"
"粘贴旧配置。非法 JSON 不会覆盖当前有效的可视化规则。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:70
#: 6ae5e43c23184d5198a740eae81f278e
msgid "固定组成示例："
msgstr "Fixed-composition example:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:72
#: f06aa32ee63541e18218d965d1d912da
msgid ""
"{\"A\":{\"elements\":[\"Fe\",\"Co\"],\"mode\":\"fixed_fraction\","
"\"composition\":{\"Fe\":0.5,\"Co\":0.5}}}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\"A\":{\"elements\":[\"Fe\",\"Co\"],\"mode\":\"fixed_fraction\","
"\"composition\":{\"Fe\":0.5,\"Co\":0.5}}}\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:76
#: 905eb9c2e3b74583980073d52176b5c5
msgid ""
"可视化编辑器要求固定比例之和为 1，例如 `0.5 + 0.5`。旧项目或直接调用 "
"operation 的 JSON 若使用 `1 + 1` 这类相对权重，底层仍会归一化以保持兼容；界面"
"新建和修改规则时不再依赖这种隐式归一化。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:78
#: f93b64eea80f4fb0929c3cb4eb149d4c
msgid "分数范围示例："
msgstr "Fraction-range example:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:80
#: 4f69001380cc4e5d84af822f2f2a1a84
msgid ""
"{\"B\":{\"elements\":[\"Al\",\"Ni\"],\"mode\":\"fraction_range\","
"\"fractions\":{\"Al\":[0.25,0.75],\"Ni\":[0.25,0.75]}}}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\"B\":{\"elements\":[\"Al\",\"Ni\"],\"mode\":\"fraction_range\","
"\"fractions\":{\"Al\":[0.25,0.75],\"Ni\":[0.25,0.75]}}}\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:84
#: 958dce5e08fe43799a5c0b7c1f81772b
msgid "整数范围示例："
msgstr "Integer-count-range example:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:86
#: d349baeb66c24379adc7586738656b8d
msgid ""
"{\"A\":{\"elements\":[\"Fe\",\"Co\"],\"mode\":\"count_range\",\"counts\":"
"{\"Fe\":[8,16],\"Co\":[8,16]}}}\n"
msgstr ""
"{\"A\":{\"elements\":[\"Fe\",\"Co\"],\"mode\":\"count_range\",\"counts\":"
"{\"Fe\":[8,16],\"Co\":[8,16]}}}\n"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:90
#: f136e49060a347b68c5e443bfb68cbf8
msgid "每种组成的排布数（arrangements_per_composition）"
msgstr "arrangements_per_composition"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:92
#: 026d1cd55d9447c8acef3e847670ea15
msgid "`int`，默认 1。每个实际整数计数组合请求多少个不同的原子排布。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 1. The number of distinct atomic arrangements requested for "
"each realized integer-count combination."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:94
#: c026414d7a274d208db4fab736f23fc2
msgid ""
"如果某个组成的理论唯一排布数小于请求值，只返回理论上存在的数量。例如两个位点"
"各放一个 Fe/Co 只有 2 种排布，请求 10 也不会复制结果凑数。"
msgstr ""
"If a composition has fewer theoretically unique arrangements than requested, "
"only the realizable number is returned. For example, two sites occupied by "
"one Fe and one Co have only two arrangements; requesting ten does not "
"duplicate results to reach the requested count."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:96
#: 74acb058641b49e3b2b868d63984c519
msgid "使用固定种子（use_seed）"
msgstr "use_seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:98
#: 06e9c9a5ef1c4e3c85efda1d5f6ad3ce
msgid ""
"`bool`，默认 true。开启后，组成预算抽样和每个组成的排布都由固定 seed 派生。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, default true. When enabled, composition-budget sampling and each "
"composition's arrangements are derived from a fixed seed."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:100
#: 20d955e9bd2244939a9d2b72c6363bb9
msgid ""
"组成可行域本身不随 seed 改变；seed 只决定超预算时选哪些计划以及元素落到哪些具"
"体位点。"
msgstr ""
"The feasible composition domain itself does not depend on the seed. The seed "
"only determines which plans are selected when over budget and which specific "
"sites receive each element."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:102
#: fd72447b92b049839448d1c961ba59c4
msgid "随机种子（seed）"
msgstr "seed"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:104
#: 83cfdad6a0d14cd0815913409478e796
msgid "`int`，默认 0。固定随机路径的基础种子。"
msgstr "`int`, default 0. Base seed for the deterministic random path."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:106
#: 1cdceb6e50404a7ca7ae300201be1984
msgid ""
"生效条件：`use_seed=true`。相同输入、规则和 seed 会得到相同 composition/"
"arrangement 顺序与占位；更换 seed 时实际计数不变，但排布通常会改变。"
msgstr ""
"Applies when `use_seed=true`. Identical inputs, rules, and seed produce the "
"same composition/arrangement order and occupancy. Changing the seed does not "
"alter realized counts, but usually changes arrangements."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:108
#: 364fb1f6e52440f5a06451b79604905c
msgid "每个输入的最大输出数（max_outputs）"
msgstr "max_outputs"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:110
#: 4dc7d95e93044934b733f31456480bce
msgid "`int`，默认 200。单个输入结构最多返回的总结构数。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default 200. Hard limit on the number of structures returned for one "
"input structure."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:112
#: bc5688150fe447889b903a9c4e3bc03d
msgid ""
"预算不足以覆盖全部组成时，operation 先在整数计划索引空间中按固定步长确定性选"
"择可覆盖的组成，再采用“组成优先”的轮转调度：先为每个选中组成生成第 1 个排布，"
"再生成各组成的第 2 个排布，以此类推。因此，小预算不会先被单一组成的多个排布耗"
