#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:150
#: f207a42ad52c47cf9b154dfb4641e92a
msgid ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`：覆盖 L1₂、B2、L1₀ 的"
"有序和分子晶格无序占位。"
msgstr ""
"`Ordered Alloy Prototype → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`: cover ordered and "
"sublattice-disordered occupancies for L1₂, B2, and L1₀."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:151
#: 2446116642a64c96a86264a05a5886f7
msgid ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder → Super Cell → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`：普通 "
"FCC/BCC 结构没有 `sublattice` 时使用 `all` 单 site set 生成随机固溶体。"
msgstr ""
"`Crystal Prototype Builder → Super Cell → Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy`: for "
"an ordinary FCC/BCC structure without `sublattice`, use the single `all` "
"site set to generate a random solid solution."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:152
#: cf17924eff414187aa7697de78192457
msgid ""
"`Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy → Atomic Perturb → Lattice Strain`：占位确定后再"
"补坐标和晶格扰动；磁矩仍交给 Magnetic Order 或 Spin Disorder。"
msgstr ""
"`Finite-Cell Alloy Occupancy → Atomic Perturb → Lattice Strain`: add "
"coordinate and lattice perturbations after occupancy is fixed; leave "
"magnetic moments to Magnetic Order or Spin Disorder."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:154
#: 6e525b41087244a997ebfbdce5796635
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:156
#: daed57866b7c4271ac994ea14cd69993
msgid ""
"**提示 missing rules 或 unknown site sets。** 顶层 key 必须逐一匹配输入 "
"`sublattice` 的实际标签；普通结构只能使用 `all`。operation 不会回退到 "
"`group`。"
msgstr ""
"**The card reports missing rules or unknown site sets.** Every top-level key "
"must match an actual input `sublattice` label. An ordinary unlabeled "
"structure can use only `all`; the operation does not fall back to `group`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:158
#: 8ab91f536fbe41d1b67d22b16a58e6d8
msgid ""
"**提示没有整数解。** 各元素计数下限之和可能大于位点数，或上限之和小于位点数。"
"分数范围也会先换算成当前晶胞可实现的整数边界，再检查总和。"
msgstr ""
"**The card reports no integer solution.** The sum of element count lower "
"bounds may exceed the number of sites, or the upper bounds may sum to less "
"than the number of sites. Fraction ranges are first converted to integer "
"bounds realizable by the current cell before the sum is checked."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:160
#: 2cdf484dd3ed4698a219f1c738aff52e
msgid ""
"**输出少于 `每种组成的排布数`（`arrangements_per_composition`）。** 该组成的"
"理论排布数已耗尽，或触发了 `每个输入的最大输出数`（`max_outputs`）。这不是随"
"机失败，卡片不会用重复排布伪造样本数。触发总输出上限时，卡片优先覆盖不同组"
"成，再为同一组成增加排布。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:162
#: 4fb8b26ad2b54603ab94cf6fd4d7b6c8
msgid ""
"**提示仍含占位元素 X。** `X` 只用于没有输入时展示规则结构，operation 会拒绝生"
"成含 `X` 的结果。接入真实结构后可让未编辑的规则自动匹配，也可以手动把 `X` 替"
"换为实际元素。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:164
#: 59e0e3eaa8514bccbddae85f613ea8e5
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:166
#: d4c01436bd5d4cadac1949d926d1cc37
msgid ""
"`Config_type` 追加 "
"`FiniteAlloy(comp=<composition_id>,arr=<arrangement_id>)`。"
"`finite_cell_alloy` metadata 是 JSON 字符串，包含每个 site set 的实际 "
"`counts`、`fractions`、请求规则、实现状态、composition ID、arrangement ID 和"
"派生 seed。"
msgstr ""
"`Config_type` appends "
"`FiniteAlloy(comp=<composition_id>,arr=<arrangement_id>)`. The "
"`finite_cell_alloy` metadata is a JSON string containing realized `counts` "
"and `fractions`, requested rules, realization status, composition ID, "
"arrangement ID, and derived seed for every site set."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:168
#: 481d626b2c9042299fc1a0f1a65c8f80
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/finite-cell-alloy-occupancy-card.md:170
#: 8550f611fa314242a541ac200323d2a1
msgid ""
"固定 `use_seed=true` 与 `随机种子`（`seed`）后严格可复现。超预算组成抽样使用"
"确定索引顺序；排布去重以逐位元素序列为准，不依赖集合迭代顺序。"
msgstr "This section explains the option, its parameters, operation, and expected result."

#~ msgid "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `FiniteCellAlloyOccupancyCard`"
#~ msgstr "`Group`: `Alloy` | `Class`: `FiniteCellAlloyOccupancyCard`"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "32 位点随机固溶体经过连续 Composition Sweep 后再取整，多个目标点可能都变成"
#~ "同一整数计数组合，训练集看似有很多组成，实际却重复。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "When continuous Composition Sweep targets are rounded on a 32-site random "
#~ "solid solution, several target points can collapse to the same integer-"
#~ "count combination. The training set appears compositionally diverse but "
#~ "actually contains duplicates."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输入：** 32 原子 A1/fcc 周期超胞。 **目标：** 直接枚举 Fe/Co/Ni 的可实现"
#~ "整数计数，并为每个组成生成 4 个不同排布。 **参数设置：** `site_rules` 使"
#~ "用 `all`（若输入含 A 单子晶格则用 `A`）和 `count_range`，给三种元素明确整"
#~ "数范围；`arrangements_per_composition=4`，固定 seed，设置 `max_outputs`。 "
#~ "**输出：** 每个 composition ID 对应唯一整数计数组合；同一 composition 下"
#~ "的 arrangement ID 不重复。 **怎么验证训练集质量改善：** 统计 metadata 中"
#~ "的 `counts`，确认每帧总和为 32、composition ID 无重复；重训时再按实际分数"
#~ "切片比较误差，而不是按原连续目标比例分组。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Input:** a periodic 32-atom A1/fcc supercell. **Goal:** enumerate "
#~ "realizable Fe/Co/Ni integer counts directly and generate four distinct "
#~ "arrangements for each composition. **Parameters:** use `all` in "
#~ "`site_rules` (or `A` for an input with a single A sublattice), select "
#~ "`count_range`, and give all three elements explicit integer ranges; set "
#~ "`arrangements_per_composition=4`, a fixed seed, and `max_outputs`. "
#~ "**Output:** each composition ID maps to a unique integer-count "
#~ "combination, and arrangement IDs are unique within a composition. **How "
#~ "to verify improved training-set quality:** aggregate the metadata "
#~ "`counts`, confirm every frame sums to 32 and composition IDs are unique, "
#~ "then compare retrained errors in slices based on realized fractions "
#~ "rather than the original continuous targets."

#~ msgid "位点划分与 Site Rules（site_rules）"
#~ msgstr "Site partitioning and Site Rules (`site_rules`)"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "默认界面使用“A/B 有序合金”模板，与默认的 Ordered Alloy Prototype 可直接连"
#~ "接："
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The default UI uses the A/B Ordered Alloy template, which connects "
#~ "directly to the default Ordered Alloy Prototype:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "“普通单晶格合金”按钮会建立 `all` 规则；“A/B 有序合金”按钮会建立彼此独立的 "
#~ "A、B 规则。JSON 顶层 key 必须与输入的 site set 完全一致。有 `sublattice` "
#~ "时逐个编辑 A、B 等标签；没有时使用 `all`。卡片不会把 `all` 静默套到每个子"
#~ "晶格。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The Single-Sublattice Alloy button creates an `all` rule; the A/B Ordered "
#~ "Alloy button creates independent A and B rules. Top-level JSON keys must "
#~ "match the input site sets exactly. Edit labels such as A and B "
#~ "individually when `sublattice` is present; use `all` when it is not. The "
#~ "card never applies `all` silently to every sublattice."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "规则仍处于初始占位状态时，载入上游结构会按实际标签自动匹配：普通无标签结构"
#~ "使用 `all`，A1/A2/A3 等单子晶格原型使用单独的 `A` 规则，L1₂/B2/L1₀ 保持 A/"
#~ "B。界面会明确提示自动匹配结果。只要用户编辑过规则、主动选择过模板、粘贴过 "
#~ "JSON 或载入过持久化参数，卡片就不再自动覆盖，标签不匹配时改为显示错误。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "While the rules are still in their initial placeholder state, loading an "
#~ "upstream structure matches them to the actual labels automatically: an "
#~ "unlabeled structure uses `all`, a single-sublattice A1/A2/A3 prototype "
#~ "uses an `A` rule, and L1₂/B2/L1₀ keeps A/B. The UI reports the automatic "
#~ "match explicitly. Once the user edits a rule, chooses a template, pastes "
#~ "JSON, or loads persisted parameters, the card stops overwriting rules "
#~ "automatically and reports label mismatches as errors."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "输入结构可用后，界面会在对应规则旁显示实际位点数，并即时提示缺少标签、多余"
#~ "标签、非法/重复元素、范围错误和无整数解。底层持久化仍是 `site_rules` 字符"
#~ "串；“高级：查看/粘贴 JSON”默认收起，可用于复制现有格式或粘贴旧配置。非法 "
#~ "JSON 不会覆盖当前有效的可视化规则。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "When an input structure is available, the UI shows the actual site count "
#~ "beside each rule and immediately reports missing or extra labels, invalid "
#~ "or duplicate elements, range errors, and infeasible integer plans. "
#~ "Persistence still uses the `site_rules` string. Advanced: View/Paste JSON "
#~ "is collapsed by default and can copy the current format or accept an "
#~ "older configuration. Invalid JSON never overwrites the current valid "
#~ "visual rules."

#~ msgid "Arrangements per Composition（arrangements_per_composition）"
#~ msgstr "Arrangements per Composition（arrangements_per_composition）"

#~ msgid "Use Seed（use_seed）"
#~ msgstr "Use Seed（use_seed）"

#~ msgid "Seed（seed）"
#~ msgstr "Seed（seed）"

#~ msgid "Max Outputs（max_outputs）"
#~ msgstr "Max Outputs（max_outputs）"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "预算不足以覆盖全部组成时，operation 在整数计划索引空间中按固定步长确定性抽"
#~ "样，不依赖 Python 集合、目录或文件系统顺序。输入结构与规则都可用时，UI 直"
#~ "接调用 `operation.estimate(...)`，显示各标签位点数、可行整数组成数、每组成"
#~ "请求排布数、截断前理论输出、`max_outputs`、预计实际输出和是否截断。没有输"
#~ "入时只提示先运行或载入上游结构，不显示伪精确数字。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If the budget cannot cover every composition, the operation samples the "
#~ "integer-plan index space deterministically at a fixed stride; it does not "
#~ "depend on Python set, directory, or filesystem order. When both input "
#~ "structure and rules are available, the UI calls `operation.estimate(...)` "
#~ "directly and reports site counts by label, feasible integer compositions, "
#~ "requested arrangements per composition, theoretical output before "
#~ "truncation, `max_outputs`, estimated actual output, and whether "
#~ "truncation occurs. Without input, it only asks the user to run or load an "
#~ "upstream structure and never presents a spurious exact estimate."

#~ msgid "L1₂ 分子晶格部分无序"
#~ msgstr "Partially disordered L1₂ sublattices"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出少于 `arrangements_per_composition`。** 该组成的理论排布数已耗尽，或"
#~ "触发了 `max_outputs`。这不是随机失败，卡片不会用重复排布伪造样本数。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output is smaller than `arrangements_per_composition`.** The "
#~ "composition's theoretically unique arrangements have been exhausted, or "
#~ "`max_outputs` was reached. This is not a random failure; the card does "
#~ "not fabricate the requested sample count with duplicate arrangements."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "固定 `use_seed=true` 与 `seed` 后严格可复现。超预算组成抽样使用确定索引顺"
#~ "序；排布去重以逐位元素序列为准，不依赖集合迭代顺序。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Runs are strictly reproducible with fixed `use_seed=true` and `seed`. "
#~ "Over-budget composition sampling uses deterministic index order, and "
#~ "arrangements are deduplicated by per-site element sequence without "
#~ "depending on set iteration order."
